            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Metabolic syndrome in pediatric and adolescent populations is particularly alarming for its frequent occurrence. Comparative analysis of dimensional typology and percentile values shows exceeding typical dimensional signs. Choosing appropriate clothes feel comfortable for such children is limited.</AbstractText>
